---
title: futex 用户态锁的等待与唤醒
type: sequence
tags: [进程管理, futex, 同步, 锁]
description: 线程A futex_wait 挂入哈希桶等待,线程B futex_wake 经 wake_up_q 唤醒,无竞争时纯用户态
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as 线程A
    participant Wait as futex_wait / __futex_wait
    participant HB as futex_hash_bucket
    participant B as 线程B
    participant Wake as futex_wake
    participant Sched as wake_up_q

    A->>Wait: futex_wait(uaddr, val)
    Wait->>Wait: futex_wait_setup()<br/>get_futex_key() 计算键,futex_hash() 定位哈希桶
    Wait->>Wait: 原子校验 uaddr 值仍等于 val<br/>避免丢唤醒
    Wait->>HB: futex_queue() 将 futex_q 挂入 hb->chain(优先级链表)
    Wait->>A: futex_do_wait() 睡眠,放弃 CPU

    B->>Wake: 释放锁,futex_wake(uaddr, nr_wake)
    Wake->>HB: futex_hash() 定位同一哈希桶,加 spin_lock
    Wake->>HB: 遍历 hb->chain,匹配 key<br/>futex_wake_mark() 标记出队
    Wake->>Sched: wake_q_add_safe() 收集待唤醒任务
    Wake->>Sched: wake_up_q() 批量唤醒
    Sched-->>A: 线程A 被唤醒,重新抢锁

    Note over A,B: 无竞争时 pthread_mutex 只做原子 CAS 增减,<br/>不进入内核,零系统调用开销
